        ("cooperative_alignment", "A cooperative-vector operation uses a misaligned constant offset or stride",
         "An imported stage declares CooperativeVectorNV or CooperativeVectorTrainingNV and a direct entry-block cooperative-vector operation has a known 32-bit constant byte offset or stride that breaks the Vulkan alignment: Matrix offset 64 bytes and row/column-major MatrixStride 16 bytes for OpCooperativeVectorMatrixMulNV/MatrixMulAddNV, BiasOffset 16, Load/Store Offset 16, ReduceSumAccumulate Offset 16, OuterProductAccumulate Offset 64. Vulkan-ValidationLayers does not check these. Buffer base alignment, dynamic and specialized offsets are not known and are skipped.",
         "Align the constant offsets and strides to the required byte multiples, padding the buffer layout if needed.",
         "Padding enlarges the buffers and changes the offsets other code must use.",
         "https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/latest/html/vkspec.html#spirvenv-module-validation-runtime",
         "VUID-RuntimeSpirv-OpCooperativeVectorMatrixMulNV-10096..10097; VUID-RuntimeSpirv-OpCooperativeVectorMatrixMulAddNV-10098; VUID-RuntimeSpirv-OpCooperativeVectorLoadNV-10099; VUID-RuntimeSpirv-OpCooperativeVectorReduceSumAccumulateNV-10100; VUID-RuntimeSpirv-OpCooperativeVectorOuterProductAccumulateNV-10101"),
        ("cooperative_offset_width", "A cooperative-vector offset is a 64-bit integer",
         "An imported stage declares CooperativeVectorNV or CooperativeVectorTrainingNV and a direct entry-block OpCooperativeVectorLoadNV, StoreNV, OuterProductAccumulateNV or ReduceSumAccumulateNV takes a 64-bit integer Offset (a constant or a loaded value of known type) while the entry point does not declare the Shader64BitIndexingEXT execution mode. The Vulkan spec requires 32-bit integer offsets otherwise; the validation layers do not check this.",
         "Pass a 32-bit integer offset, or enable 64-bit indexing for the pipeline and declare Shader64BitIndexingEXT.",
         "Narrowing the offset limits addressable buffer size.",
         "https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/latest/html/vkspec.html#spirvenv-module-validation-runtime",
         "VUID-RuntimeSpirv-OpCooperativeVectorLoadNV-11809"),
